DO-SPLIT-VALIDATE.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-PX-PARMS
    MOVE "Y" TO XP-SPLIT
    MOVE "OUT" TO XP-DIRECTION
    MOVE "MANUAL" TO XP-MODALITY
    MOVE "PROD" TO XP-ENV
    MOVE WS-B TO WS-AMT-STR
    PERFORM PARSE-AMOUNT
    MOVE WS-AMT TO XP-AMOUNT
    MOVE "BRL" TO XP-CURRENCY
    MOVE 0 TO XP-SPLIT-TOTAL XP-SPLIT-TAX XP-SPLIT-EXT
    MOVE WS-C TO XP-PAYER-ACCT
    MOVE WS-A TO WS-LGS
    PERFORM PARSE-LEGS
    IF XP-RC NOT = "00"
        DISPLAY "rc=20"
        DISPLAY "msg=" FUNCTION TRIM(XP-MSG)
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE 0 TO XP-FEE-AMT XP-BLOCK-AMT XP-DATE XP-COUNT
