DO-SPLIT-REVERSE.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-PX-PARMS
    MOVE "PIX-DEVOL-REQUEST" TO XP-OP
    MOVE "Y" TO XP-SPLIT
    MOVE WS-A TO XP-ORIG-PIX-ID
    MOVE "BRL" TO XP-CURRENCY
